Package: tk-html3
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libtk8.6
Description: HTML and CSS rendering widget for Tk (Tkhtml 3.0, TkinterWeb's fork)
 Tkhtml 3.0 is a Tk widget that displays HTML 4 and CSS 2.1 pages: block and inline layout,
 floats, tables, borders, backgrounds and images handed to it by the application, without
 scripts. This is TkinterWeb's maintained fork of Dan Kennedy's widget, the one its Python
 interface (python3-tkinterweb) is written for. It installs the Tcl package Tkhtml 3.0
 (package require Tkhtml) for Tcl/Tk 8.6.
